duplicates-review = Review Candidates for Selected Items…
    .label = Review Candidates for Selected Items…
duplicates-bulk = Bulk Merge Current Library Using Retained Item Strategy…
    .label = Bulk Merge Current Library Using Retained Item Strategy…
duplicates-pause = Pause / Resume Bulk Merge
    .label = Pause / Resume Bulk Merge
duplicates-cancel = Stop Bulk Merge
    .label = Stop Bulk Merge
duplicates-data-heading = Non-duplicate Data
duplicates-data-description = Mark false positives as Not Duplicates in the review dialog. Decisions use library identities and stable item keys. Zoplicate-format JSON import/export supports cross-device transfer without unsupported Zotero synced settings. Statistics refresh on demand instead of scanning the library on each import.
duplicates-export = Export Non-duplicate Decisions…
